From: Octo <180629317+OctoAlgo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 11:51:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] stage table: the stages a mission registers, in order;
 checkpoint list prints them; checkpoint #<n>

The title registers each stage of a mission through one native (MISSION_STAGE_ADD) and asks for the
items of a stage through another (MISSION_STAGE_ITEM). The hook records, per mission (the registering
script), the stages in registration order with a count of items and registrations. The channel logs
one line per stage and a summary when the registrations pause. `checkpoint list` prints the running
mission's table; `checkpoint #<n>` jumps to its n-th stage. The jump itself is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Kit-Source: own (inkVI-dive, checkpoints)
